// Repo config.
//
// This files doesn't reach the build. Schema: SCHEMA.md
//
// default-image defines what image builds when no target is named.
// This is required once a second image exists.
// Named by the image id, not by file name.
// eg.
// default-image "image-name"
//
// Which image a pull request builds.
// eg.
// pr-image "image-name"
//
// Workflows turn workflows in .github/workflows/ on or off, named by filename stem.
// A reconcile workflow (.github/workflows/reconcile-workflows.yml) runs when updates
// to this file are commited and enables/disabled workflows through the Github API.
// Therefore reconcile-workflow cannot be disabled here and will skip itself.
// Any workflow not listed runs by default.
// eg.
// workflows {
//     smoke-test enabled=#false
// }
